Third-party components

aveto-support downloads, at `ingest`, and does not redistribute in this repository:

- BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5, revision 5c38ec7c405ec4b44b94cc5a9bb96e735b38267a
  (ONNX weights and vocabulary, sha256-pinned in docs-source.toml). License declared
  on its model card: MIT. Source: https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5

The public service image (Dockerfile) contains this model and no reranker. The
cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L6-v2 reranker was closed "nothing ships" and is not in
the image; its license question (MS MARCO training data) stays open and must be resolved
before it is ever shipped.

The documentation corpus the support agent answers from is the Aveto playbook
(https://github.com/gpatwa/agentic-sdlc-playbook) at the commit pinned in
docs-source.toml, also licensed under Apache-2.0.
